[[64,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and (1b), then remove the engine oil return\npipe from EGR solenoid to throttle body (1c).</p><p>2. Remove the gaskets.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2015294.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[64,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the rigid pipe from EGR solenoid\nto  throttle body in its housing complete with gasket and fix it with\nthe bolts.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[512,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and (1b), then remove the engine oil return\npipe from EGR solenoid to throttle body (1c).</p><p>2. Remove the gaskets.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2015295.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[512,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the rigid pipe from EGR solenoid\nto  throttle body in its housing complete with gasket and fix it with\nthe bolts.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]